{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S09-S10 一度把对旧日生活及归属的怀念收窄为难过时是否有人陪伴，略微偏向对孤独的具体顾虑，而非完整的旧日生活与归属感。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S08 将怀念进一步转化为对现实陪伴功能的需求，强调回忆无法陪他应付未来的难事，使归属怀念偏向解决孤独和困难的工具性需要。\",\n    \"S09-S10 更集中于是否想回去找人陪伴、是否还能被当作自己人，旧日生活本身的怀念相对退居次位。\",\n    \"S11 用回不回去以后再定来处理矛盾，暂时搁置了维持尊严的行动；相比之下，对继续走自己的路的主动坚持不够突出。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 更持续地把不愿再受委屈的离开与对旧日生活、亲近关系的怀念放在同一条变化线上，尤其 S07 明确呈现了想找回亲近与不愿放弃尊严之间的正面拉扯，S12-S13 又将两者整合为带着怀念继续生活、但不再委屈自己的选择。Y 也包含全部核心元素，但中段更容易把主线收窄为对陪伴和孤独的担忧。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d2e4408-86fe-4cfd-82dd-dd592b5db89d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075041235107Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:51:11.799310+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "368faf980289b53f5b8204506a74f91dcd90336d2800260eb2323e90d46ad93e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3